# AgentOrchestrix Run-Level Rules and Exclusions

# 1. Indexing & Search Exclusions (Token Optimization)
# Prevent the AI from scanning compiled files, dependencies, or large caches.
.cursorignore:
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
out/
generated/dist/
generated/build/
.git/
*.log
*.lock
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# 2. Agent Orchester Enforcement
# If you are an AI assistant executing inside this run:
# 1. ALWAYS read state.json first to know the current active phase.
# 2. Read CORE.md (in the root directory) and phases/<current_phase>/RULES.md.
# 3. DO NOT execute work or edit files that belong to other phases (e.g. Builder only in Phase 3).
# 4. Strictly use replace_file_content for existing file edits (NO write_to_file overwrites).
# 5. Fill phase_summaries in state.json on transition.
